cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Longitudinal Deep Learning for Alzheimer's Disease Detection from Structural MRI"
abstract: >-
  A controlled study of whether longitudinal structural change and
  anatomy-guided auxiliary supervision improve Alzheimer's disease detection
  over a single-scan 3D baseline, evaluated under a subject-level partitioning
  protocol with cognitive-test scores excluded from the inference pathway.
